nt</span><br><span>📱 Interested in Android development</span><br><span>🤖 Exploring AI, automation, and developer productivity</span><br><span>🌱 Always learning and experimenting with new technologies</span><br><span>💡 I enjoy turning real-world problems into simple technical solutions</span><br><span>🏆 Featured Projects</span><br><span>🌦️ Weather Log Parser</span><br><span>A lightweight web application built with Python, Flask, HTML, and CSS for uploading, parsing, displaying, and analyzing weather log data.</span><br><br><span>&lt;</span><span>a href="https</span><span>:</span><span>//github.com/TAMILSELVANM30/-weather-log-parser"&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>img src="https</span><span>:</span><span>//github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/pin/?username=TAMILSELVANM30&amp;repo=-weather-log-parser&amp;theme=tokyonight&amp;hide_border=true" alt="Weather Log Parser"/&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>/a&gt;</span><br><span>🩺 HealthWise Assistant</span><br><span>A mini project that uses user-provided symptoms to provide a disease prediction/health-assistance experience.</span><br><br><span>&lt;</span><span>a href="https</span><span>:</span><span>//github.com/TAMILSELVANM30/healthwise_assistant"&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>img src="https</span><span>:</span><span>//github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/pin/?username=TAMILSELVANM30&amp;repo=healthwise_assistant&amp;theme=tokyonight&amp;hide_border=true" alt="HealthWise Assistant"/&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>/a&gt;</span><br><span>🛠️ Tech Stack</span><br><span>👨‍💻 Languages</span><br><span>&lt;</span><span>p&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>img src="https</span><span>:</span><span>//img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=python&amp;logoColor=white"/&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>img src="https</span><span>:</span><span>//img.shields.io/badge/SQL-336791?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=postgresql&amp;logoColor=white"/&gt; </span><span>&lt;</span><span>img src="https</span><span>:</span>