ing", "Robotics/IoT"]</span><br><span>philosophy: "Understand the suit before you fly it — no black-box building."</span><br><span>currently_building: "KAPPAN — a self-healing platform for AI agent failures"</span><br><span>`</span><span>`</span><span>`</span><br><br><span>-</span><span> 🔭 Currently engineering </span><span>*</span><span>*</span><span>KAPPAN</span><span>*</span><span>*</span><span>, an autonomous "doctor" for AI agents — detects, diagnoses, sandbox-validates, and recovers agent failures in a closed loop.</span><br><span>-</span><span> 🧠 Deeply interested in </span><span>*</span><span>*</span><span>multi-agent architectures</span><span>*</span><span>*</span><span>, explainable AI, and building real systems with real API calls — not mocked demos.</span><br><span>-</span><span> 🏆 Active in the hackathon circuit — Smart India Hackathon, Odoo Hackathon (finals @ Odoo HQ, Gandhinagar), and more.</span><br><span>-</span><span> ⚙️ I l</span></p></div></div></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="block">…</span></div><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-none text-user-message not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent data-[state=open]:bg-transparent border-transparent border-0 p-0 mt-1.5 self-start text-size-chat" aria-expanded="false" data-thread-find-skip="true" data-markdown-copy="exclude"><span>Show more</span><svg width="20" height="21" viewBox="0 0 20 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-2xs"><path d="M15.2793 7.71101C15.539 7.45131 15.961 7.45131 16.2207 7.71101C16.4804 7.97071 16.4804 8.39272 16.2207 8.65242L10.4707 14.4024C10.211 14.6621 9.78902 14.6621 9.52932 14.4024L3.77932 8.65242L3.69436 8.54792C3.52385 8.28979 3.55205 7.93828 3.7