G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">Madara Uchiha theme</div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">I'll retain your actual name, GitHub username, projects, technologies, and statistics.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Use these design settings in your README:</p><div class="TableFrame-YxtDrz" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-component="table"><div class="TableViewport-RD3I2I" data-d-table-viewport="true"><table class="Table-QT1UX2" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-dividers="" style="table-layout: auto;"><tbody><tr data-d-component="table-row"><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Element</p></th><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Theme</p></th></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Background</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Black</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Primary</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Crimson red</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Accent</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" 